(6960975, 1048500, 122678, '<td valign="top">congratulations! I thought I posted prior to your winning...<br/>This picture is absolutely beautiful and perfectly processed, I gave it a 10, as it is at the top of my favorite photo list. It has a natural quality to it, although the setting and colors are too perfect not be orchestrated. My goal would be to create images like this, its so nice to see your eye and quality in this shot. I love it!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-01-19 11:20:25.</i></td>', 'congratulations! I thought I posted prior to your winning...This picture is absolutely beautiful and perfectly processed, I gave it a 10, as it is at the top of my favorite photo list. It has a natural quality to it, although the setting and colors are too perfect not be orchestrated. My goal would be to create images like this, its so nice to see your eye and quality in this shot. I love it!', '2013-01-19 11:19:29.000000', '2013-01-19 11:20:25.000000', 0),
